{
  "_doc": "How tools/audio.py drives Motocross Maniacs' sound engine. RAM names come from ram.inc. PlaySound starts a sound directly; here the id goes into wSoundQueued, which UpdateSound starts at the end of its first tick. Seven channels: 0-2 effects (square 1, square 2, noise), 3-6 music (square 1, square 2, wave, drums); the drum channel's notes start drum sounds 1-7 on channel 2.",
